                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Fun, but if you want to customize your experience be prepared to pay. Any setting is locked behind a DLC. Should of just included all features for a couple bucks more.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1793589419,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1793589419,
                        "voted_up": false,
                        "votes_up": 0,
                        "votes_funny": 0,
                        "weighted_vote_score": 0.5,
                        "comment_count": 0,
                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "We released this game in 2017 and it had no DLC. Every year we are adding new DLC for a very cheap price. This way everybody could still afford the main game for under $5 and buy only the DLCs wanted (no need to buy them all if player doesn't want to). And now we added missions and badges and they can be used to UNLOCK DLC FOR FREE. We even added DLC trials (as bonus from the free spin). Our game is open for everybody!",
                        "timestamp_dev_responded": 1793681491,
